ay":0,"offers":[],"made":0},"tournaments":{"localsDay":0,"localsPlayed":0,"localsWon":0,"prereleaseDay":0,"current":null},"messages":[{"text":"Marcus from IT looks over the partition. He looks at the card taped to your terminal for a long time. \"Base set,\" he says, and goes back down.","kind":"good","count":1},{"text":"You say \"circling back\" out loud, to nobody. +$0.50","kind":"info","count":1},{"text":"You kick the machine. Nothing happens. A security guard looks up from his pretzel.","kind":"warning","count":1},{"text":"A checklist falls out of the pack. Every card in the Base Set, numbered 1 to 120. You take it home and put it on the fridge. You have not put anything on the fridge since 1998.","kind":"good","count":1},{"text":"You open your first pack in years. Your hands remember how.","kind":"info","count":1},{"text":"*thunk* A pack drops out of A2.","kind":"info","count":1},{"text":"*thunk* A pack drops out of A1.","kind":"info","count":1},{"text":"There is a vending machine at the back of the mall. It sells Critter Clash packs. It has been there since you were seven. It has been waiting.","kind":"good","count":1},{"text":"Your laptop dings. It is your boss, Linda. It is Tuesday, which is an office day. You have to go in. Hybrid is three days a week. Nobody remembers choosing which three.","kind":"info","count":1},{"text":"You decide to give yourself an allowance. $1.20 a minute. You are a responsible adult.","kind":"info","count":1}]}}